{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12232070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12232070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1223207001:0":{"text":"아! 당신 물건을 잃어버린 것뿐이잖아. 뭘 그렇게 소리까지 질러대!","source_cn":"喂！不就是弄丢了你的东西吗？叫嚷什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x793A1DBCE5EF3DAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223207002:0":{"text":"아이고, 동네 사람들! 물귀신이 나를 등쳐먹으려고 하네!","source_cn":"大家快来看啊，水鬼耍赖了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x783F257CB6F7CCA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223207003:1":{"text":"물건을 잃어버려놓고 돈도 안 갚아, 이젠 협박까지 해!","source_cn":"不仅弄丢了我的东西不赔钱，还威胁要打我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE206F2A501559D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223207004:1":{"text":"아니, 물건이 너무 많아서 옮기다 좀 잃어버린 게 내 잘못이라고?","source_cn":"谁让你的东西那么多，来回搬来搬去，丢了能怪我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3148846E708DAE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223207005:1":{"text":"시... 시끄러워! 배상이나 해! 아니면 블러디 로즈에게 고발하겠어!","source_cn":"你……你！少废话，赔钱！不然我就找血薇帮来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D0F96C1D5CD93D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223207006:1":{"text":"사장님, 걱정 마시죠. 얼마나 필요한지 말씀하시면 배상하겠습니다.","source_cn":"老板别担心，你给个数，我们赔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9952689DD4369CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223207007:1":{"text":"1만 골드! 당장 배상해!","source_cn":"一万金币！给钱吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AE2A790810F1153","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223207008:1":{"text":"그게 무슨 말도 안 되는 소리야? 과일 두 박스가 뭐 그렇게 비싸?!","source_cn":"你打劫呢？！两箱水果值这么多钱？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7FC33589D63C13C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223207009:1":{"text":"물건값에 인건비, 그리고 내 정신적 피해보상!! 전부 합쳐서 1만 골드야. 이 정도면 적게 부른 거라고!","source_cn":"货品损失费，误工费，以及我的心情损失费，一万金币，我还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7690F1991EBFC73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223207010:1":{"text":"젠장, 돈을 이만큼 토해내면 형제들 앞에서 얼굴을 들 수가 없는데!","source_cn":"妈的！老子今天要是给了这个钱，以后在兄弟们面前头都抬不起！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58D37D0B756403DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223207011:1":{"text":"돈이 필요한 거지? 내가 금니로 바꿔줄까? 금은 값이 나가니...!","source_cn":"要钱是吧？我给你换颗金牙吧？金牙多值钱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6D9DBF6AA3E7C51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1223207012:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주세요! 물귀신이 해코지하려고 합니다!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8A08E729A9C265F5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주세요! 물귀신이 해코지하려고 합니다!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주세요! 물귀신이 해코지하려고 합니다!","variant_male_record_index":"138323","variant_female_record_index":"138324","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1223207013:1":{"text":"세실, 속에서 천불이 끓는 건 알겠어, 말리진 않을게.","source_cn":"西索，你心里有火，我不拦你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04B7AD736C29B77F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1223207014:1":{"text":"다만 그 주먹으로 진짜 사람을 때린다면, 법정에서 랄프와 만나겠지.","source_cn":"你想清楚，这一拳下去，你就能去和关在审判庭的劳夫做邻居了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48427B3822BE955","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1223207015:1":{"text":"젠장, 그럼 1만 골드가 있긴 해?!","source_cn":"妈的！难道你有一万金币？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB70AD068B1039EC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1223207016:1":{"text":"없지. 하지만...","source_cn":"我没有，但——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB96178C4521C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1223207016":{"text":"없지. 하지만...","source_cn":"我没有，但——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB96178C4521C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1223207017:0":{"text":"왜 우리를 보는 거예요? 돈이 있다고 해도 이건 여러분이 스스로 배상해야 하는 거라고요!","source_cn":"别看我们，我们就算有，这个钱也该你们自己赔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD506BE673B766253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1223207018:0":{"text":"맞아요. 남의 물건을 잃어버린 거잖아요!","source_cn":"没错，毕竟你弄丢了别人的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D2086B186BC7DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1223207019:1":{"text":"돈이 부족하면 좀 깎아달라고 해보는 건 어때요?","source_cn":"如果钱不够，试着向对方砍价呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE0E802BF46FF883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1223207020:1":{"text":"깎